    // we penalize the current choice to favor keeping the residual space large enough for the next item.
    if next_item_size > 0 && post_residual < next_item_size {
        score += 20.0;
    }

    // 3. Open bins pressure: As the stream progresses, penalize opening new bins unless necessary.
    // If we are looking at a new bin (bin_residual == bin_capacity), increase the cost 
